{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The controller confirmed the scoped ReadIndex finding with no remaining blockers. Membership validation also rules out the simple observer-vote suspicion: full members cannot be demoted to observers, removed IDs cannot be re-added, and nonzero read-confirmation heartbeats go only to voters. I’m examining recovery and scheduling paths for a different unresolved premise.\n"}}
