{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"I found a timing distinction worth investigating. Ordinary configuration application publishes the shared applied watermark after the Raft membership callback returns. Snapshot recovery publishes that watermark before calling `RestoreRemotes`. Because the election guard uses the watermark, I’ll check whether serialization prevents a step worker from consuming it while Raft still has the old membership.\n"}}
